#. de: Sammler-Ober<shy>schenkel<shy>knochen
#. fr: fémur sale de dilettante
#. column 2: connoisseur's soiled femurs
#. column 8: A material harvested with the discerning standards of an avid collector in mind, and well suited to aetherial reduction. Whether the layer of filth is truly required for it to maintain this property remains unclear, but why take the risk?
#. column 9: Connoisseur's Soiled Femur
msgctxt "Item:39805:0:0"
msgid "connoisseur's soiled femur"
msgstr "заляпанная бедренная кость ценителя"

#. de: Sammler-Ober<shy>schenkel<shy>knochen
#. fr: fémurs sales de dilettante
#. column 0: connoisseur's soiled femur
#. column 8: A material harvested with the discerning standards of an avid collector in mind, and well suited to aetherial reduction. Whether the layer of filth is truly required for it to maintain this property remains unclear, but why take the risk?
