#. ja: ドラゴンフルーツ
#. de: Drachenfrucht
#. fr: fruit dragon
#. column 2: dragonfruits
#. column 8: This milky white fruit is shielded by scaly skin not entirely unlike that of dragonkind, though whether any member of the race approves of this comparison to vividly pink produce remains an open question.
#. column 9: Dragonfruit
msgctxt "Item:39864:0:0"
msgid "dragonfruit"
msgstr "плод дракона"

#. de: Drachenfrüchte
#. fr: fruits dragon
#. column 0: dragonfruit
#. column 8: This milky white fruit is shielded by scaly skin not entirely unlike that of dragonkind, though whether any member of the race approves of this comparison to vividly pink produce remains an open question.
#. column 9: Dragonfruit
msgctxt "Item:39864:0:2"
msgid "dragonfruits"
msgstr "плоды дракона"

#. ja: 竜鱗のような紅い皮に守られた、甘い白色の果実
#. de: Unter der roten Schale, welche die Form von Drachenschuppen hat, verbirgt sich das weiße und süße Fruchtfleisch dieser Köstlichkeit.
#. fr: Un fruit sucré ressemblant à une écaille de dragon.
#. column 0: dragonfruit
#. column 2: dragonfruits
#. column 9: Dragonfruit
msgctxt "Item:39864:0:8"
msgid "This milky white fruit is shielded by scaly skin not entirely unlike that of dragonkind, though whether any member of the race approves of this comparison to vividly pink produce remains an open question."
msgstr "Молочно-белая мякоть этого плода скрыта под чешуйчатой кожурой, подозрительно похожей на драконью. Впрочем, одобряют ли сами драконы сравнение с ярко-розовым фруктом, остаётся загадкой."

