msgid "Dragonfruit"
msgstr "Плод дракона"

#. ja: ダークエッグプラント
#. de: düster[a] Aubergine
#. fr: aubergine noire du mage
#. column 2: dark eggplants
#. column 8: When asked to explain its flavor profile, a culinarian claimed that this subtropical eggplant is “a little, hmm...richer?” than the average wizard eggplant. This presumably means something to those versed in the inscrutable art of cuisine, who employ this nightshade in a wide variety of dishes.
#. column 9: Dark Eggplant
msgctxt "Item:39865:0:0"
msgid "dark eggplant"
msgstr "тёмный баклажан"

#. de: düster[a] Auberginen
#. fr: aubergines noires du mage
#. column 0: dark eggplant
#. column 8: When asked to explain its flavor profile, a culinarian claimed that this subtropical eggplant is “a little, hmm...richer?” than the average wizard eggplant. This presumably means something to those versed in the inscrutable art of cuisine, who employ this nightshade in a wide variety of dishes.
#. column 9: Dark Eggplant
msgctxt "Item:39865:0:2"
msgid "dark eggplants"
msgstr "тёмные баклажаны"

#. ja: 幅広い調理法に適した、亜熱帯原産の濃紫色の果菜
#. de: Dieses dunkelviolette Gemüse wächst in den Subtropen und eignet sich für eine Vielzahl von Zubereitungsarten.
#. fr: Un légume violacé aux teintes sombres, très utilisé en cuisine et poussant dans les régions subtropicales.
#. column 0: dark eggplant
#. column 2: dark eggplants
#. column 9: Dark Eggplant
msgctxt "Item:39865:0:8"
msgid "When asked to explain its flavor profile, a culinarian claimed that this subtropical eggplant is “a little, hmm...richer?” than the average wizard eggplant. This presumably means something to those versed in the inscrutable art of cuisine, who employ this nightshade in a wide variety of dishes."
msgstr "Кулинар, которого попросили описать вкус этого субтропического баклажана, сказал: «Он... э-э... чуть насыщеннее обычного баклажана волшебника». Видимо, знатокам загадочного кулинарного искусства этого достаточно: они добавляют этот паслён в самые разные блюда."

#. ja: ダークエッグプラント
#. de: Düstere Aubergine
#. fr: Aubergine noire du mage
#. column 0: dark eggplant
#. column 2: dark eggplants
#. column 8: When asked to explain its flavor profile, a culinarian claimed that this subtropical eggplant is “a little, hmm...richer?” than the average wizard eggplant. This presumably means something to those versed in the inscrutable art of cuisine, who employ this nightshade in a wide variety of dishes.
msgctxt "Item:39865:0:9"
msgid "Dark Eggplant"
msgstr "Тёмный баклажан"

#. ja: 高級クミン
#. de: Handvoll[p] feinster Kreuzkümmelsamen
#. fr: pincée de cumin supérieur
#. column 2: pinches of pure cumin
#. column 8: This bright, earthy spice is prized for its versatility both culinary and otherwise, appearing in all manner of medicinal tinctures and beauty treatments.
#. column 9: Pure Cumin
msgctxt "Item:39866:0:0"
msgid "pinch of pure cumin"
msgstr "щепотка очищенного кумина"

#. de: Handvoll[p] feinster Kreuzkümmelsamen
