msgstr "Очищенный кумин"

#. ja: キャビアフィッシュ
#. de: Kaviarfisch
#. fr: poisson à caviar
#. column 2: caviar sturgeons
#. column 8: As its name implies, the eggs produced by this incredibly rare freshwater fish are considered something of a culinary miracle when salted and served as caviar.
#. column 9: Caviar Sturgeon
msgctxt "Item:39867:0:0"
msgid "caviar sturgeon"
msgstr "осётр с икрой"

#. de: Kaviarfische
#. fr: poissons à caviar
#. column 0: caviar sturgeon
#. column 8: As its name implies, the eggs produced by this incredibly rare freshwater fish are considered something of a culinary miracle when salted and served as caviar.
#. column 9: Caviar Sturgeon
msgctxt "Item:39867:0:2"
msgid "caviar sturgeons"
msgstr "осетры с икрой"

#. ja: 希少な淡水魚。その魚卵は高級嗜好品とされ、特に塩漬けした品は美食家に愛好されている
#. de: Seltener Süßwasserfisch. Sein Rogen gilt als luxuriöse Delikatesse, insbesondere die gesalzenen Rogen sind bei Feinschmeckern sehr begehrt.
#. fr: Un poisson d'eau douce rare dont les œufs sont ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment prisés. Ils sont le plus souvent dégustés avec une pincée de sel.
#. column 0: caviar sturgeon
#. column 2: caviar sturgeons
#. column 9: Caviar Sturgeon
msgctxt "Item:39867:0:8"
msgid "As its name implies, the eggs produced by this incredibly rare freshwater fish are considered something of a culinary miracle when salted and served as caviar."
msgstr "Эта чрезвычайно редкая пресноводная рыба славится своей икрой. Засоленную и поданную как деликатес, её считают настоящим чудом кулинарии."

