msgctxt "Item:39867:0:9"
msgid "Caviar Sturgeon"
msgstr "Осётр с икрой"

#. ja: ブロコフラワー
#. de: Romanesco-Kohlkopf
#. fr: fleur de brocoli
#. column 2: heads of broccoflower
#. column 8: A unique vegetable boasting a fractal form that has baffled botanists for generations. Though tempting, it is best not to stare directly at its illusory buds.
#. column 9: Broccoflower
msgctxt "Item:39868:0:0"
msgid "head of broccoflower"
msgstr "головка броккоцвета"

